{"4579270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "魔律物语-韦德霍尔克学院(Magos-Wadeholke)", "steam_appid": 4579270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Magos-Wadeholke》 is an Action RPG set primarily within a magical academy, striving to deliver a classic JRPG experience. You take on the role of a new student enrolling at &quot;Wadeholk Academy,&quot; where you will experience a vibrant campus life, explore the mysteries of magical power, and ultimately become a powerful mage. During your time at the academy, you can attend classes, tackle assignments, and complete quests alongside the companions you meet, all while deepening your bonds with them. Together, you will explore the enigmatic island of &quot;Galodia&quot;—a land where all four seasons coexist—uncover truths that have lain buried for a millennium, and confront an impending crisis...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/27bf600196e8b84e5fae0f00e1fe7aaf.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/27bf600196e8b84e5fae0f00e1fe7aaf.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/c304075cb02a1bfd1b6799b671c642dc.poster.avif?t=1781513496\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/c304075cb02a1bfd1b6799b671c642dc.webm?t=1781513496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/c304075cb02a1bfd1b6799b671c642dc.mp4?t=1781513496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's main stage is &quot;Galodia,&quot; a mysterious island where all four seasons exist simultaneously. Wadeholk Academy—the institution the protagonist is set to attend—is situated right upon this island. Renowned as the world's premier magical academy, Wadeholk boasts a comprehensive array of educational facilities and a faculty of exceptional, distinct personalities. Students from every corner of the globe gather here to study together and grow side-by-side. It is here that the protagonist will embark on a colorful and enriching campus journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/ca1830daca17f538bb9254cca5779116.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/ca1830daca17f538bb9254cca5779116.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/17571713723e2d8459684e63e88689d3.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/17571713723e2d8459684e63e88689d3.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/17be26fdb87c7dd2eec55dbaaebc36ef.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/17be26fdb87c7dd2eec55dbaaebc36ef.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/62d1c8d6cbb2f5cdf9c2e2520d091b7c.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/62d1c8d6cbb2f5cdf9c2e2520d091b7c.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Elemental Magic,&quot; &quot;Runic Magic,&quot; &quot;Alchemy&quot;... The protagonist is free to choose from three distinct schools of magic, each with its own unique characteristics. Whether you choose to specialize in a single discipline or master a combination of several is entirely up to you; by deeply customizing your skill loadout, you can forge a combat style that is uniquely your own. Engage in exhilarating, fluid real-time combat, blasting away every obstacle standing in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/dfb5881d3d774fde674a8870872f40b3.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/dfb5881d3d774fde674a8870872f40b3.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/7dc3ce9b3b72f05b2e95d0a9d9d5efcc.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/7dc3ce9b3b72f05b2e95d0a9d9d5efcc.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/89d229a69a07158da2323120c2050a92.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/89d229a69a07158da2323120c2050a92.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a classic, archetypal narrative centered on the core themes of &quot;Friendship, Courage, and Passion.&quot; Through a twist of fate, the protagonist becomes entangled in a series of wondrous adventures—reminiscent of the *Adventure Team* series—working alongside companions to uncover truths buried for a thousand years and confronting a monumental crisis that threatens the very existence of the world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/56b65759ecaac6b364a8ea5ffd35f100.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/56b65759ecaac6b364a8ea5ffd35f100.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/4c89840d3b84bb4afe8b7e05c3898228.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/4c89840d3b84bb4afe8b7e05c3898228.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the story, the protagonist will encounter and befriend a diverse cast of companions hailing from all over the world. Though their backgrounds and personalities vary wildly—and their paths would never have crossed otherwise—destiny has conspired to gather them by the protagonist's side, ready to face every adventure and challenge that lies ahead. As you spend time with them, you can cultivate deeper bonds, gradually learning their personal stories and helping them resolve their own struggles. In doing so, you will earn their gratitude and friendship—and perhaps even forge relationships that evolve into something even more intimate...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Magos-Wadeholke》 is an Action RPG set primarily within a magical academy, striving to deliver a classic JRPG experience. You take on the role of a new student enrolling at &quot;Wadeholk Academy,&quot; where you will experience a vibrant campus life, explore the mysteries of magical power, and ultimately become a powerful mage. During your time at the academy, you can attend classes, tackle assignments, and complete quests alongside the companions you meet, all while deepening your bonds with them. Together, you will explore the enigmatic island of &quot;Galodia&quot;—a land where all four seasons coexist—uncover truths that have lain buried for a millennium, and confront an impending crisis...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/27bf600196e8b84e5fae0f00e1fe7aaf.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/27bf600196e8b84e5fae0f00e1fe7aaf.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/c304075cb02a1bfd1b6799b671c642dc.poster.avif?t=1781513496\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/c304075cb02a1bfd1b6799b671c642dc.webm?t=1781513496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/c304075cb02a1bfd1b6799b671c642dc.mp4?t=1781513496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's main stage is &quot;Galodia,&quot; a mysterious island where all four seasons exist simultaneously. Wadeholk Academy—the institution the protagonist is set to attend—is situated right upon this island. Renowned as the world's premier magical academy, Wadeholk boasts a comprehensive array of educational facilities and a faculty of exceptional, distinct personalities. Students from every corner of the globe gather here to study together and grow side-by-side. It is here that the protagonist will embark on a colorful and enriching campus journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/ca1830daca17f538bb9254cca5779116.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/ca1830daca17f538bb9254cca5779116.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/17571713723e2d8459684e63e88689d3.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/17571713723e2d8459684e63e88689d3.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/17be26fdb87c7dd2eec55dbaaebc36ef.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/17be26fdb87c7dd2eec55dbaaebc36ef.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/62d1c8d6cbb2f5cdf9c2e2520d091b7c.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/62d1c8d6cbb2f5cdf9c2e2520d091b7c.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Elemental Magic,&quot; &quot;Runic Magic,&quot; &quot;Alchemy&quot;... The protagonist is free to choose from three distinct schools of magic, each with its own unique characteristics. Whether you choose to specialize in a single discipline or master a combination of several is entirely up to you; by deeply customizing your skill loadout, you can forge a combat style that is uniquely your own. Engage in exhilarating, fluid real-time combat, blasting away every obstacle standing in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/dfb5881d3d774fde674a8870872f40b3.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/dfb5881d3d774fde674a8870872f40b3.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/7dc3ce9b3b72f05b2e95d0a9d9d5efcc.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/7dc3ce9b3b72f05b2e95d0a9d9d5efcc.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/89d229a69a07158da2323120c2050a92.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/89d229a69a07158da2323120c2050a92.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a classic, archetypal narrative centered on the core themes of &quot;Friendship, Courage, and Passion.&quot; Through a twist of fate, the protagonist becomes entangled in a series of wondrous adventures—reminiscent of the *Adventure Team* series—working alongside companions to uncover truths buried for a thousand years and confronting a monumental crisis that threatens the very existence of the world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/56b65759ecaac6b364a8ea5ffd35f100.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/56b65759ecaac6b364a8ea5ffd35f100.webp?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras/4c89840d3b84bb4afe8b7e05c3898228.avif?t=1781513496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579270/extras_big/4c89840d3b84bb4afe8b7e05c3898228.avif?t=1781513496 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the story, the protagonist will encounter and befriend a diverse cast of companions hailing from all over the world. Though their backgrounds and personalities vary wildly—and their paths would never have crossed otherwise—destiny has conspired to gather them by the protagonist's side, ready to face every adventure and challenge that lies ahead. As you spend time with them, you can cultivate deeper bonds, gradually learning their personal stories and helping them resolve their own struggles. In doing so, you will earn their gratitude and friendship—and perhaps even forge relationships that evolve into something even more intimate...</p>", "short_description": "《Magos-Wadeholke》 is an action RPG with classic JRPG feel. Play as a magic apprentice: enjoy campus life, learn magic, become a mage. Team up with friends for courses, quests, bonding. Explore Galodia, the four-season island, to uncover ancient secrets and face crisis.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste